<div class="img1-container">
    <img class="img1" src="~/images/happy-dog.jpg" alt="Happy Dog" />
    <!--https://www.pexels.com/photo/a-dog-s-head-outside-a-car-window-9738676/-->
    <img class="img1" src="~/images/running-dog.jpg" alt="Running Dog" />
    <!--https://www.pexels.com/photo/brown-long-coated-small-dog-running-on-green-grass-field-8081421/-->
    <img class="img1" src="~/images/funny-dog.jpg" alt="Funny Dog" />
    <!--https://www.pexels.com/photo/stylish-white-pomeranians-wearing-sunglasses-outdoors-34531298/-->
</div>

<section class="p1">

    <h1>Pawfolio: A happier, healthier life for your pets</h1>
    <h3>Because every paw deserves the best care.</h3>

    <p class="intro-box">
        Pawfolio is a pet health management system created to help pet owners
        manage and monitor their pets' health information in one place.
        Whether you want to keep track of your pet's weight, record changes
        in behavior, organize medical history, or remember important care
        activities, Pawfolio makes it easier to keep everything organized.
        Our mission is to help pet owners stay informed about their pets'
        health while making it easier to share important information with
        veterinary professionals when needed.
    </p>

</section>


<section class="p2">
    <img class="pic" src="~/images/management.jpg" alt="Pet health care management" />
    <!--https://www.pexels.com/photo/woman-petting-a-dog-while-holding-a-paper-6919719/-->
    <div class="text-content">
        <h3>All your pet's health information in one place.</h3>

        <p>
            With Pawfolio, you can create and manage profiles for your pets
            and keep track of important information such as weight,
            measurements, appearance, behavior, and food. You can record
            new health information over time, review previous records, and
            download your pet's health information when needed.
            Keeping this information organized helps you monitor changes
            and have important details available when caring for your pet.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="p3">
    <h3>Care made easier for every pet owner.</h3>

    <div class="features">
        <div class="feature">
            <h4>Pet Profiles</h4>
            <p>
                Create and manage profiles for multiple pets, keeping their
                personal information and health details organized in one place.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
            <h4>Health History & Weight Tracking</h4>
            <p>
                Record health information, track weight changes over time,
                and review previous records to monitor your pet's health.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
            <h4>Reminders & Care Activities</h4>
            <p>
                Keep track of important care reminders and receive
                recommended activities and care information based on
                your pet's recorded information.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
            <h4>Share Health Records</h4>
            <p>
                Authorize veterinary professionals to access your pet's
                health records, making it easier to share relevant
                information when your pet needs care.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="p4">
    <div class="text-content">
        <h3>Better communication. Better care.</h3>

        <p>
            Pawfolio also supports veterinary professionals by allowing
            authorized users to review shared pet health records, monitor
            changes, and add notes or updates when needed. Pet owners remain
            in control of who can access their pet's information and can
            revoke access when necessary.
        </p>

        <p>
            Whether you are managing your pet's everyday health information
            or sharing records with a veterinary professional, Pawfolio
            helps keep important information accessible and organized.
        </p>
    </div>

    <img class="pic" src="~/images/care.jpg" alt="Pet care" />
    <!--https://www.pexels.com/photo/person-hand-holding-dog-paw-20195994/-->
</section>

<section class="p5">
    <h3>Start your pet's health journey with Pawfolio.</h3>

    <p>
        Create your account and discover a simpler way to organize,
        monitor, and share your pet's health information.
    </p>

    <a class="btn pawfolio-btn"
       asp-area="Identity"
       asp-page="/Account/Register">
        Get Started
    </a>
</section>